_paragraph\" ><strong>4 cat mage classes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Francis:</strong> a blind, battle-hardened warrior monk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluppy:</strong> a brilliant professor of arcane magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi:</strong> a brave samurai and descendant of a legendary Ice Catalan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flocki:</strong> a famous detective with a fiery temper</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 biomes:</strong> Step into the Portal of Furlins and explore legendary locations: the mystical ancient Egypt, the sunken depths of Catlantis, and the forgotten dungeons of the Catjinns.<br>Each biome is full of unique challenges, secrets, and powerful rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical traps:</strong> Use traps strategically and turn them to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize and upgrade:</strong> Strengthen your team with visible gear, unlock new skills, and choose from magical weapons to master every quest. On your way to the ultimate weapons of the Catjinn kings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60 unique weapons and abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 challenging enemy types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 18 powerful bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 days and nights of survival challenges</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955630/extras/69b2e6305bcfbda2bece1d54a992e296.poster.avif?t=1758926100\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955630/extras/69b2e6305